## What we are doing
1. Open a Saturday clinic at Eastgate starting 2026-11-07. Eastgate lost Dr. Hana Yoshida in August and has 2 open physician posts.
2. Send text reminders two days before visits. The Lakeview pilot cut its no-show rate from 8.0 to 5.9 percent.
3. Keep the phone lines at Harlan Street open until 19:00.
